<translate>
==== OtherHandRequire ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Parameter for weapons. A parameter that determines the required item in the extra hand to use the original item.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
OtherHandRequire = Lighter,
</syntaxhighlight>
